does not take part in the bullying of Murakoshi, but that does not mean she likes him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A typical Japanese girl with long hair (tied up with a ribbon or something)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a relatively slim figure and average breast size."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13277"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"『催眠学園』のヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏和で優しく、学園のアイドル的存在の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"茶道や生け花などの習い事をしており、和服姿も様になっている日本的な少女だ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"村越のいじめに参加することはないが、好いていることもない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほっそりした体型で、乳サイズは普通。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25373","sourceWorkId":"2790","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"温和で優しい女の子で、学園のアイドル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"茶道や活け花などの、習い事を多くしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"村越に対するいじめには参加していないが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好いているなどということはない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ロングヘアー（リボン等でまとめている）の日本的少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"比較的ほっそりとした体型で、乳サイズは普通。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"89375"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/916cdd5603a41290e3d9dcce07f13223c7f92ab8cd48948fbf45347978a6632e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/926760e4ee8400186bd2685cb3e9477a17c2fec90b8919309a04d327e31d7894.webp","width":145,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c13279","characterName":"矢野 みどり","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12611","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"20151"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25375"],"vndbCharacterId":"c13279"},"originalCharacterName":"矢野 みどり","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"s